  "translations": [
    {
      "unique_index": 0,
      "cn_text": "Kaz，你呢？　你想扩大MSF吗？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 39,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SOURCE_IDEOGRAPHIC_SPACE_PRESERVED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 1,
      "cn_text": "当然。就像你说的，我想把MSF发展成不受任何国家干涉的组织。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 84,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 2,
      "cn_text": "为了保护自己，我们也需要与之相称的力量。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 60,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 3,
      "cn_text": "要养活大批兵力，也得花钱。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 39,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 4,
      "cn_text": "为此，我想让MSF成为一种更新型的生意。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 54,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 5,
      "cn_text": "不只是直接战斗，而是连后勤、训练、武器维护和开发，以及一切军事相关事务都能承包的组织。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 129,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 6,
      "cn_text": "既有特种部队那样少数精锐的行动力，又有足以对抗正规军的军事力量。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 96,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 7,
      "cn_text": "只有拥有这种力量，我们才能摆脱国家的干涉。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 63,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 8,
      "cn_text": "总之，Boss，你就用富尔顿回收把能派上用场的人都收集过来。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 82,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_SHIFTED_REFERENCE_IGNORED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 9,
      "cn_text": "然后，人事配置也拜托你来下指示。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 48,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_SHIFTED_REFERENCE_IGNORED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 10,
      "cn_text": "剩下的琐事交给我就行。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 33,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_SHIFTED_REFERENCE_IGNORED"
    }
  ]
